Adaptation 04-readonly-why-bounded-babysit

why stays strictly read-only; a denied read is recorded as a gap, never retried through a broader mode.
babysit defers to an installed babysit-pr, keeps one owner per PR, writes only commits and pushes on the
PR's head branch, reads every page of review comments, and reports the round cap as blocked, never ready.
Updated for pstack 0.15.46's one-file why skill.

Fork source: https://github.com/mneves75/pstack-claude commits 2d6b8b8, 3151149 (rebased to 1ab6b82).
Applies to the port's plugins/pstack/skills tree after the patches numbered before it.

